sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as ai-gateway-operator<br/>8081/TCP health<br/>8443/TCP metrics
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/opt/manifests
    participant BatchGW as batch-gateway-operator
    participant MaaS as maas-controller
    participant AIGWC as ai-gateway-controller

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Platform,AIGWC: Flow 1: Sub-Component Deployment (AIGateway Reconciliation)
        Platform->>K8sAPI: Creates/updates AIGateway CR<br/>ServiceAccount auth
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: AIGateway changed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Read AIGateway CR<br/>Determine ManagementState
        Operator->>FS: Render vendored kustomize manifests<br/>with image/namespace params
        FS-->>Operator: Rendered resources
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply resources<br/>(Deployments, RBAC, CRDs, Services)
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources applied
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Check sub-component readiness
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note over Platform,AIGWC: Flow 2: MaaS Graceful Teardown
        Platform->>K8sAPI: Set modelsAsAService<br/>managementState=Removed
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: AIGateway changed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Annotate maas-controller Deployment<br/>teardown-requested=true
        MaaS->>K8sAPI: Execute self-teardown<br/>Delete Config/default, clean up tenants
        MaaS->>K8sAPI: Annotate own Deployment<br/>teardown-completed=true
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: Deployment annotation changed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Garbage-collect MaaS and<br/>ai-gateway-controller resources
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
        Note over Platform,AIGWC: Flow 3: Platform Upgrade Handshake
        Platform->>K8sAPI: Create/update odh-aigateway-config<br/>ConfigMap with platformVersion
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: ConfigMap changed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Read platformVersion from ConfigMap
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile sub-components
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Echo platformVersion into<br/>AIGateway status.releases
    end
